==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Big Sal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Big Sal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]] and spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] as soon as you can. It is recommended to use Starting Money [[Cat Combo]]s if you wish to beat the stage as quickly as possible.

